WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
I thought that would be, of the seven wars that I stopped,

00:04.000 --> 00:05.500
I thought that would be the easiest

00:05.500 --> 00:08.100
because of my relationship with President Putin,

00:08.100 --> 00:10.000
which had always been a good one.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.100
I thought that was going to be the easiest one.

00:12.100 --> 00:15.000
But you know, in war, you never know what's going to happen.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.500
There are always lots of surprises, both good and bad.

